@limit N 
@offset N
> searchWeb
Search query here

@sourceLink URL of result here
> searchResult
Search result here
===}}```

Tool:
``` convo {{===
> define
SearchResultItem=struct(
    // Link to source
    link?:string
    result:string
)
SearchResult=struct(
    results:array(SearchResultItem)
)

> searchWeb(query:string limit?:number offset?:number) -> SearchResult
===}}```

